{
  "_notes": [
    "Generated by `npm run behavior:discover-projects`, then edited by hand.",
    "",
    "This file is OPTIONAL. Without it, ./project-analyzer.ts groups changes by Graphify community,",
    "which gives correct subsystem grouping but no human metadata. Filling in owner/team/slack is",
    "what turns 'Secret Versioning & Commits is affected' into 'tell this person, in this channel'.",
    "",
    "Matching precedence per changed file, first hit wins:",
    "  1. path_globs    - a path prefix ('src/services/secret/**'), suffix ('*-dal.ts'), or exact path",
    "  2. service_keys  - the server.services.<key> the file's module is wired to",
    "  3. communities   - a Graphify community name; these are LLM-generated and are RENAMED on every",
    "                     graphify run, so prefer path_globs for anything you rely on",
    "",
    "analysis.wide_threshold: past this many reachable routes a changed file is reported as a count",
    "  and a list of subsystems instead of an enumeration. src/lib/errors/index.ts reaches 471 route",
    "  files; listing them is noise, not impact.",
    "analysis.max_depth: how many import hops to follow back from a changed file."
  ],
  "analysis": {
    "wide_threshold": 40,
    "max_depth": 3
  },
